{"id":"bfa02b501ab2c114","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-forcing-regular-open-completion.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Regular Open Completion","display":"df-zfc-forcing-regular-open-completion — ZFC Forcing Regular Open Completion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-regular-open-completion","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-regular-open-completion","58-df-zfc-forcing8-regular-open-completion","58-df-zfc-forcing12-regular-open-completion"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-regular-open-completion — ZFC Forcing Regular Open Completion","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-forcing]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-regular-open-completion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-regular-open-completion</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing8-regular-open-completion</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing12-regular-open-completion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-regular-open-completion — ZFC Forcing Regular Open Completion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"58-df-forcing\">58-df-forcing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P\\)</span> (forcing poset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\)</span> (forcing order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_{\\mathbb P}\">\\(1_{\\mathbb P}\\)</span> (top condition)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb P}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb P}\\)</span> (downward Alexandrov topology generated by condition cones)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> (candidate regular-open completion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\)</span> (forcing-poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRegularOpenCompletion}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRegularOpenCompletion}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}regular\\text{-}open\\text{-}completion} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingRegularOpenCompletion}_S(B,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\exists\\tau_{\\mathbb P}\\;\\Bigl(\\tau_{\\mathbb P}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb P:\\forall p\\in U\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb P\\;(q\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\to q\\in U)\\}\\land B=\\{U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb P}:U=\\operatorname{Int}_{\\tau_{\\mathbb P}}(\\operatorname{Cl}_{\\tau_{\\mathbb P}}(U))\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}regular\\text{-}open\\text{-}completion} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingRegularOpenCompletion}_S(B,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\exists\\tau_{\\mathbb P}\\;\\Bigl(\\tau_{\\mathbb P}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb P:\\forall p\\in U\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb P\\;(q\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\to q\\in U)\\}\\land B=\\{U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb P}:U=\\operatorname{Int}_{\\tau_{\\mathbb P}}(\\operatorname{Cl}_{\\tau_{\\mathbb P}}(U))\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The topology is explicit, so the interior and closure operations are no longer ambiguous.</li>\n<li>Alias predicates are downstream wrappers around this completion predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-forcing]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S$ (forcing-poset predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{\\mathbb P}","display":false},{"tex":"1_{\\mathbb P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb P}","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRegularOpenCompletion}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}regular\\text{-}open\\text{-}completion} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingRegularOpenCompletion}_S(B,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\exists\\tau_{\\mathbb P}\\;\\Bigl(\\tau_{\\mathbb P}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb P:\\forall p\\in U\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb P\\;(q\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\to q\\in U)\\}\\land B=\\{U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb P}:U=\\operatorname{Int}_{\\tau_{\\mathbb P}}(\\operatorname{Cl}_{\\tau_{\\mathbb P}}(U))\\}\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1685,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1983","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-forcing-regular-open-completion.md|58-df-zfc-forcing-regular-open-completion]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d06ac5a66d69d291","b5833df5ef175153"]}